            <mxCell id="32" value="&lt;b&gt;Flow: cloudseccorner_cnapp_remediation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; 1. T1190 / Initial Access: Adversary probes public entry point&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; 2. WAF inspects traffic and routes to Public ALB&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; 3. Execution: Traffic routed to container pod in hardened private subnet&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; 4. KSPM Admission: OPA Gatekeeper enforces non-root, read-only rootfs, and dropped Linux capabilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; 5. CNI Defense: Kubernetes NetworkPolicy restricts ingress and egress paths&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; 6. T1552 / Credential Access: Compromised pod attempts credential harvesting&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;7&lt;/span&gt; 7. T1530 / Exfiltration Attempt: Attacker attempts unauthorized S3 exfiltration&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;8&lt;/span&gt; 8. CWPP Anomaly Detection: GuardDuty &amp;amp; CloudTrail flag abnormal S3/IMDS activity&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;9&lt;/span&gt; 9. Orchestration: EventBridge captures high-severity finding and triggers remediation&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;10&lt;/span&gt; 10. Dynamic Isolation: Lambda pushes OPA quarantine constraint&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;11&lt;/span&gt; 11. Network Containment: Lambda locks pod egress via NetworkPolicy&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#E74C3C;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:bold'&gt;12&lt;/span&gt; 12. Posture &amp;amp; Compliance: Security Hub and CloudSecCorner CNAPP dashboard record remediation" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=14;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                  <mxGeometry x="782.1" y="2109.7" width="1380.7" height="530.5" as="geometry" />
            </mxCell>
